  "doubts": "The circuit can be walked in either direction; it is described from North Egmont to Holly Hut first, but the text does not say clockwise or anticlockwise. No road-end feature is where the Holly Hut/Veronica Loop Track leaves North Egmont, so the start uses the place North Egmont (T21). Pouākai Hut has no entry (it is 5 minutes down the Mangorei Track from the junction). 'PouākaiTrig (1,440 m)' taken as the peak Pouākai (T24). The Ahukawakawa Track access point is stated as from Holly Hut on the Around the Mountain Circuit, so its ref is the track. DOC gives no total distance (sections 7.5 + 4.5 + 13 km)."
